Reason: Wet Mario (port_puddles.h, set by a mod through api->reflections): Mario's own draw (TMario::perform's two passes of his draw buffers: body, cap, hands, FLUDD; not Yoshi's) is drawn with his wetness (port_wet_mario_draw), which the renderer's vertex lighting turns into slightly darker cloth with a soft highlight from its lights and a sheen at its edges (platform/gx, u_wet), and back to dry for what follows. Off, nothing changes.

